            <div class="tab-content active" id="description-tab">
                <h3>Detailed Description</h3>
                <p>Our Heritage Velvet Dog Bed is designed with your pet's comfort and your home's aesthetic in mind. The exterior is crafted from premium velvet fabric that is both soft to the touch and durable enough to withstand daily use. The interior features high-density orthopedic memory foam that conforms to your pet's body, providing exceptional support for joints and muscles.</p>
                <p>The bed includes a removable, machine-washable cover for easy cleaning, ensuring your pet always has a fresh and hygienic sleeping space. The non-slip bottom keeps the bed securely in place, while the elevated edges provide a sense of security and a perfect spot for resting their head.</p>
                <p>Whether your furry friend is a small lap dog or a large breed, this bed offers the perfect combination of luxury, comfort, and durability that discerning pet owners expect.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-content" id="specifications-tab">
                <h3>Product Specifications</h3>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0;">
                    <li><strong>Material:</strong> Premium Velvet Fabric</li>
                    <li><strong>Fill:</strong> Orthopedic Memory Foam</li>
                    <li><strong>Cover:</strong> Removable and Machine Washable</li>
                    <li><strong>Bottom:</strong> Non-Slip Rubber Grips</li>
                    <li><strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</li>
                    <li><strong>Available Colors:</strong> Brown, Charcoal, Tan, Beige</li>
                    <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2-Year Limited Warranty</li>
                    <li><strong>Certification:</strong> CertiPUR-US Certified Foam</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-content" id="shipping-tab">
                <h3>Shipping & Returns</h3>
                <p><strong>Shipping:</strong> Free insured shipping worldwide. Orders typically ship within 1-2 business days and arrive in 3-7 business days.</p>
                <p><strong>Returns:</strong> We offer a 30-day return policy. Items must be in original condition with all packaging. Pet beds must be unused and in original packaging for return eligibility.</p>
                <p><strong>Warranty:</strong> All products come with a 2-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Contact our customer service team for any warranty claims.</p>
                <p><strong>Exchange Policy:</strong> Free exchanges within 14 days of delivery for size or color changes. Contact us to initiate an exchange.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-content" id="reviews-tab">
                <!-- Review Form -->
                <div class="review-form editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="64">
                    <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="65" data-text="44">Add Your Review</h3>
                    <form id="reviewForm">
                        <div class="rating-input">
                            <label>Your Rating:</label>
                            <div class="star-rating-input" id="starRating">
                                <span class="star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-rating="1" data-default-class="fas fa-star">★</span>
                                <span class="star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-rating="2" data-default-class="fas fa-star">★</span>
                                <span class="star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-rating="3" data-default-class="fas fa-star">★</span>
                                <span class="star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-rating="4" data-default-class="fas fa-star">★</span>
                                <span class="star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-rating="5" data-default-class="fas fa-star">★</span>
                            </div>
                            <input type="hidden" id="ratingValue" name="rating" value="0">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="reviewerName">Your Name</label>
                            <input type="text" id="reviewerName" name="name" required>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="reviewTitle">Review Title</label>
                            <input type="text" id="reviewTitle" name="title" required>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="reviewText">Your Review</label>
                            <textarea id="reviewText" name="review" rows="4" required></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit-review editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="66" data-text="45">Submit Review</button>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <!-- Customer Reviews -->
                <div class="customer-reviews editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="67">
                    <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="68" data-text="46">Customer Reviews</h3>
                    
                    <div class="review-item">
                        <div class="review-header">
                            <div class="reviewer-name">Sarah Johnson</div>
                            <div class="review-date">March 15, 2025</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-rating">
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-text">Absolutely love this bed! My golden retriever immediately took to it and sleeps so peacefully now. The velvet is luxurious and the foam is high quality. Worth every penny!</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="review-item">
                        <div class="review-header">
                            <div class="reviewer-name">Michael Chen</div>
                            <div class="review-date">March 10, 2025</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-rating">
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="far fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="far fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-text">Great quality bed. My older dog with arthritis seems much more comfortable. The cover is easy to remove and wash. Only minor complaint is that it took a couple of days to fully expand after unpacking.</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="review-item">
                        <div class="review-header">
                            <div class="reviewer-name">Emma Rodriguez</div>
                            <div class="review-date">March 5, 2025</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-rating">
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                            <i class="fas fa-star-half-alt editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star-half-alt"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="review-text">Beautiful bed that matches my home decor perfectly. My two cats have claimed it as their own! The quality is excellent and it's held up well to daily use. Highly recommend.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="related-products editable-section" data-section="69">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="70" data-text="47">You May Also Like</h2>
            <div class="related-products-grid">
                <div class="related-product-card">
                    <a href="?page=product-details&id=2">
                        <div class="related-product-img editable-image" data-image="12" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/6963939/pexels-photo-6963939.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500')"></div>
                        <div class="related-product-info">
                            <div class="related-product-name">Silk Feather Wand Toy</div>
                            <div class="related-product-price">$48</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="related-product-card">
                    <a href="?page=product-details&id=3">
                        <div class="related-product-img editable-image" data-image="13" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/4060140/pexels-photo-4060140.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500')"></div>
                        <div class="related-product-info">
                            <div class="related-product-name">SpaEase Grooming Kit</div>
                            <div class="related-product-price">$145</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="related-product-card">
                    <a href="?page=product-details&id=4">
                        <div class="related-product-img editable-image" data-image="14" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/5967508/pexels-photo-5967508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500')"></div>
                        <div class="related-product-info">
                            <div class="related-product-name">Artisan Stoneware Bowl</div>
                            <div class="related-product-price">$68</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="related-product-card">
                    <a href="?page=product-details&id=5">
                        <div class="related-product-img editable-image" data-image="15" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/1121378/pexels-photo-1121378.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500')"></div>
                        <div class="related-product-info">
                            <div class="related-product-name">Modern Cat Tree Tower</div>
                            <div class="related-product-price">$189</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Product Image Thumbnail Switcher
        const thumbnails = document.querySelectorAll('.thumbnail');
        const mainImage = document.getElementById('main-product-image');

        thumbnails.forEach(thumbnail => {
            thumbnail.addEventListener('click', function() {
                thumbnails.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
                this.classList.add('active');
                const newImage = this.getAttribute('data-full-image');
                mainImage.style.backgroundImage = `url('${newImage}')`;
            });
        });

        // Product Color Variant Selection
        const colorOptions = document.querySelectorAll('.color-option');
        colorOptions.forEach(option => {
            option.addEventListener('click', function() {
                colorOptions.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
                this.classList.add('active');
                console.log('Selected color:', this.getAttribute('data-color'));
            });
        });

        // Product Size Variant Selection
        const sizeOptions = document.querySelectorAll('.variant-option[data-size]');
        sizeOptions.forEach(option => {
            option.addEventListener('click', function() {
                sizeOptions.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
                this.classList.add('active');
                console.log('Selected size:', this.getAttribute('data-size'));
            });
        });

        // Tab Switching
        const tabHeaders = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-header');
        const tabContents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');

        tabHeaders.forEach(header => {
            header.addEventListener('click', function() {
                const tabId = this.getAttribute('data-tab');
                tabHeaders.forEach(h => h.classList.remove('active'));
                tabContents.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
                this.classList.add('active');
                document.getElementById(`${tabId}-tab`).classList.add('active');
            });
        });

        // Star Rating System
        const stars = document.querySelectorAll('.star-rating-input .star');
        const ratingValue = document.getElementById('ratingValue');

        stars.forEach(star => {
            star.addEventListener('click', function() {
                const rating = parseInt(this.getAttribute('data-rating'));
                ratingValue.value = rating;
                stars.forEach((s, index) => {
                    if (index < rating) {
                        s.classList.add('selected');
                    } else {
                        s.classList.remove('selected');
                    }
                });
            });

            star.addEventListener('mouseover', function() {
                const rating = parseInt(this.getAttribute('data-rating'));
                stars.forEach((s, index) => {
                    if (index < rating) {
                        s.style.color = 'var(--primary-warm)';
                    }
                });
            });

            star.addEventListener('mouseout', function() {
                const currentRating = parseInt(ratingValue.value);
                stars.forEach((s, index) => {
                    if (index >= currentRating) {
                        s.style.color = 'rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.2)';
                    }
                });
            });
        });

        // Review Form Submission
        const reviewForm = document.getElementById('reviewForm');
        if (reviewForm) {
            reviewForm.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                const name = document.getElementById('reviewerName').value;
                const title = document.getElementById('reviewTitle').value;
                const review = document.getElementById('reviewText').value;
                const rating = ratingValue.value;

                if (rating === '0') {
                    alert('Please select a rating');
                    return;
                }

                console.log('Review submitted:', { name, title, review, rating });
                alert('Thank you for your review!');
                reviewForm.reset();
                stars.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('selected'));
                ratingValue.value = '0';
            });
        }

        // Buy Now Button
        document.querySelector('.btn-buy-now')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
            const selectedColor = document.querySelector('.color-option.active')?.getAttribute('data-color');
            const selectedSize = document.querySelector('.variant-option.active')?.getAttribute('data-size');
            console.log('Buy Now:', { color: selectedColor, size: selectedSize });
            alert('Proceeding to checkout...');
        });

        // Add to Cart Button
        document.querySelector('.btn-add-to-cart-details')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
            const selectedColor = document.querySelector('.color-option.active')?.getAttribute('data-color');
            const selectedSize = document.querySelector('.variant-option.active')?.getAttribute('data-size');
            console.log('Added to cart:', { color: selectedColor, size: selectedSize });
            alert('Item added to cart!');
        });

        // Wishlist Button
        document.querySelector('.btn-wishlist-details')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
            console.log('Added to wishlist');
            alert('Item added to wishlist!');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>